                \&amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2110.01320"}> arXiv:2110.01320
                \&amp;rbrack;
              %blockquote
                %p “Verifying programs is especially important in the quantum setting due to how difficult it is to program complex algorithms correctly on resource-constrained and error-prone quantum hardware.”
            %li
